WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.319
Week 31: Comparison, Register, and Idiomatic Force. make a nuanced comparison praise or criticize appropriately interpret idioms from context

2
00:00:10.319 --> 00:00:32.871
Read for the situation. El equipo celebró porque el proyecto iba viento en popa, pero una analista pidió tomar las cifras con pinzas. Su cautela dio en el clavo cuando apareció un error. The team celebrated because the project was going very well, but an analyst asked them to treat the figures with caution. Her caution proved exactly right when an error appeared.

3
00:00:32.871 --> 00:00:41.441
Read again for evidence. Identify who acts, what changes, when it happens, and which words establish the relationship between events.

4
